# Supabase Integration + Registration & Task Management

Add Supabase as the database layer, create a staff registration page, and build a full task management system where staff can view responsibilities and add/manage tasks with rich metadata.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Supabase Credentials**: You'll need to provide your Supabase project URL and anon key. I'll create a `.env` file placeholder — you'll fill in the actual values.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Storage Bucket**: The task system includes document upload. You'll need to create a Supabase storage bucket named `task-documents` in your Supabase dashboard with appropriate policies.

> [!WARNING]
> **Auth Strategy**: Since you mentioned you'll handle the backend processing yourself, I'll set up Supabase client-side auth (email/password) for registration/login but wire it so you can easily swap to your own auth. The registration page will collect staff details and insert into a `staff` table. You'll connect the actual Supabase auth flow later.

