## Proposed Changes

### Supabase Setup & Database Schema

#### [NEW] [supabaseClient.js](file:///e:/Projects/RoleSync-AI/client/src/lib/supabaseClient.js)
- Initialize Supabase client with env variables (`VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`)
