#### [NEW] [.env.example](file:///e:/Projects/RoleSync-AI/client/.env.example)
- Template with `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` and `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` placeholders

#### [NEW] [supabase_setup.sql](file:///e:/Projects/RoleSync-AI/supabase_setup.sql)
SQL file to run in Supabase SQL Editor containing:

**`staff` table:**
| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `id` | uuid (PK) | Default `gen_random_uuid()` |
| `full_name` | text | NOT NULL |
| `email` | text | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |
| `password_hash` | text | For your backend auth — stores hashed password |
| `department` | text | e.g. "Computer Science" |
| `designation` | text | e.g. "Assistant Professor" |
| `contact` | text | Phone number |
| `user_type` | text | 'Admin' or 'Faculty' (default 'Faculty') |
| `status` | text | 'Active', 'Leaving', 'Exited' (default 'Active') |
| `avatar_url` | text | Optional profile picture |
| `created_at` | timestamptz | Default `now()` |

**`task_categories` table:**
| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `id` | uuid (PK) | Default `gen_random_uuid()` |
| `name` | text | UNIQUE, NOT NULL |
| `icon` | text | Icon identifier |
| `color` | text | Hex color for UI |

Pre-seeded with: Subject Teaching, Practical Teaching, Program Coordinating, Seminar Responsibility, Internship Responsibility, Scholarship Responsibility, Examination Duty, Research/Project Guidance, Other

**`tasks` table:**
| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `id` | uuid (PK) | Default `gen_random_uuid()` |
| `title` | text | NOT NULL |
| `description` | text | Detailed notes |
| `category_id` | uuid (FK) | → `task_categories.id` |
| `assigned_to` | uuid (FK) | → `staff.id` (primary owner) |
| `created_by` | uuid (FK) | → `staff.id` |
| `status` | text | 'Not Started', 'In Progress', 'Done', 'Overdue' |
| `priority` | text | 'Low', 'Medium', 'High', 'Urgent' |
| `date_assigned` | date | When the task was assigned |
| `deadline` | date | Due date |
| `notes` | text | Additional notes |
| `document_url` | text | Supabase storage URL for uploaded file |
| `document_name` | text | Original filename |
| `created_at` | timestamptz | Default `now()` |
| `updated_at` | timestamptz | Default `now()` |

**`task_coordinators` table** (many-to-many for co-coordinators):
| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `id` | uuid (PK) | Default `gen_random_uuid()` |
| `task_id` | uuid (FK) | → `tasks.id` ON DELETE CASCADE |
| `staff_id` | uuid (FK) | → `staff.id` ON DELETE CASCADE |
| UNIQUE | | `(task_id, staff_id)` |

Plus **Row Level Security (RLS)** policies and an **`updated_at` trigger**.

