### Supabase Service Layer

#### [NEW] [taskService.js](file:///e:/Projects/RoleSync-AI/client/src/services/taskService.js)
Functions for CRUD operations:
- `fetchTasks(staffId)` — Get all tasks assigned to a staff member
- `fetchTasksByCategory(staffId, categoryId)` — Filter by category
- `createTask(taskData)` — Insert a new task with all fields
- `updateTask(taskId, updates)` — Update task status/details
- `deleteTask(taskId)` — Remove a task
- `addCoordinators(taskId, staffIds)` — Add co-coordinators
- `uploadDocument(file)` — Upload to Supabase storage, return URL
- `fetchCategories()` — Get all task categories
- `fetchAllStaff()` — For co-coordinator selection dropdown

#### [NEW] [staffService.js](file:///e:/Projects/RoleSync-AI/client/src/services/staffService.js)
- `registerStaff(data)` — Insert into `staff` table
- `getStaffByEmail(email)` — Lookup for login
- `fetchAllStaff()` — List all staff (for coordinator picker)

